{"server":"cn","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_07_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_07","title":"11:08P.M.","storyCode":"CB-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"6e1c8254e460e4b0970798892c7c129d6ec081eda6efe7be28ac8c5d4df68c6c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"战局一片混乱，莫斯提马也再次现身并加入战局，游刃有余地牵制住了敌方领袖。然而沙暴突然出现，鼠王毫无征兆地出手打散了众人。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊，哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"再来啊，企鹅物流！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这不是关系挺好的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"干嘛要冲着我来！？吃我一锤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！你到底是帮哪边的！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是我动的手！是那个天使！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"诶嘿，打歪了，也没差啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"趁现在——危险！你往我这儿砍做什么！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我还是觉得应该忠于首领！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也是啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"都躺地上干什么？没死的都爬起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"这么勉强部下可不好哦，有医疗补贴吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......有点混乱，但总之把穿黑衣服的全部打趴下就行了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"真是乱成一锅粥啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊——欸！？莫斯提马小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但是看你们还挺有活力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......你什么时候来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"老板喊我来的嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，是那个奇怪的萨科塔人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"给我滚开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，冷静一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里打赢了又能有什么结果？各退一步吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她把首领给挡住了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不对！那是法杖！首领小心！她是个术师！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来没有和她正面作战是正确的选择......喂，先不要靠近他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......我从没见过你这样的萨科塔，不，你是萨卡兹？你到底是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"普通的信使啊，不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"故弄玄虚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"该死——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"中场休息一下......你们大概是不会听的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你在小看我！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"别来无恙，各位，上次见面是多久以前了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看哪里！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"有个几年了？还是几个月？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咕呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"日子过得太充实，就会让人忘记时间呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"......差不多四年零三个月哦，莫斯提马。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那还真是好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"别摆出那种表情嘛，你有那么一点点严肃我都会觉得你生病了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不是感人的重逢吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"感人与否先不论，但现在不是时候叙旧呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的打算在这里动手吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"只是适当运动一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......那好吧，记得手下留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，还有另一位客人在等着我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"无论看几次都觉得，莫斯提马小姐轻描淡写地挥舞法杖，结果总是会很夸张呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"那些黑手党已经吓傻了耶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻，是不是该趁现在多敲晕两个？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？不继续了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许你的确有些实力，但我发誓不会让你轻松离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"别总是这么杀气腾腾的，就当是饭后运动吧——唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么了，刚才这些火焰是不是凝固了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来伊斯正好路过这附近，还是速战速决吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你在自言自语些什么？面对我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你变得越来越焦躁了，作为一名家族领袖，这样可不利于控制战局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！你那副游刃有余的样子真是让人恼火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"法术！快躲开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"别去帮倒忙了，我们去对付企鹅物流就行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们好像被小看了，让他们见识见识吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"得令！嘿——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是信使，莫斯提马......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"信使......外面的信使都是这样的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——起风了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"——风？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，撤退，快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！怎么开始地震了！？那个术师做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"真是，老年人总是这么心急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"别想跑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，这是法术，先撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"沙尘暴？在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"情况是不是有点不太妙！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯！这边是出口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"拜松和莫斯提马人呢？唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"他们被沙暴隔开了，我去一趟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，能天使！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，每次和莫斯提马有关，这家伙就头脑发热。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯！莫斯提马！你们在哪儿！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，眼睛里进了沙子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不要慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"遮住风沙，跟着我走就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......话说回来，这么近距离感受一番，的确是一位不该随便招惹的老先生呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"地面、地面塌陷了！是流沙，后退！不要被卷进去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"首领！请下指示！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人呢！卡彭呢！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"趁着沙尘暴离开了，有一些我们的人混在他们的队伍里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"首领！这里也要塌了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......走，我们还有机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"该死！到底发生了什么！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"机会，机会......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......我怎么不记得，你们剩下什么机会？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克萨斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可颂"]},{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["莫斯提马"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
